  "description": "Six years ago, novelist Jung Seon lost everything, including his young son and his marriage. To escape the grief, he moves to a quiet rural village for a teaching gig, where he forms an unexpected, deep bond with an orphan named Hyeon-Wu. Just as they grow inseparable, Hyeon-Wu vanishes without a word on the eve of his adulthood. Two years later, he suddenly reappears as a charismatic stage actor, ready to script a new, intense chapter in their lives.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
